Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||11-08-2001||11:28 AM||||Gageby's show-trailer with the seats has a vinyl cover to go over the entire front during trasport. It keeps water out from the top, but they hadn't anticipated the water getting in from the lower edges of the vinyl  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Here's a couple more of David's...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trail02.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trail01.jpg"> ||||reg||1
